{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CfbhwF1XqGwcTRwYXFEjC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`git rebase --onto` lets you choose a new base for a range of commits. Normal `git rebase` replays the commits onto the tip of the branch you name. With `--onto` you can also decide which commits get moved and where they go.\n\n### Syntax\n\n```\ngit rebase --onto <newbase> <upstream> [<branch>]\n```\n\nThis takes the commits in `<upstream>..<branch>` (on `<branch>`, but not on `<upstream>`) and replays them onto `<newbase>`. If you leave out `<branch>`, it uses the current branch.\n\n### Example: move a branch off another feature branch\n\nYou branched `feature-b` from `feature-a`, but `feature-b` only needs to be based on `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                 \\\nfeature-a:        C---D\n                       \\\nfeature-b:              E---F\n```\n\n```bash\ngit rebase --onto main feature-a feature-b\n```\n\nGit takes the commits on `feature-b` that aren't on `feature-a` (just `E` and `F`) and replays them onto `main`:\n\n```\nmain:       A---B\n                |\\\nfeature-a:      | C---D\n                 \\\nfeature-b:        E'---F'\n```\n\n`C` and `D` stay on `feature-a` only. `E'` and `F'` are new commits with the same changes as `E` and `F`, but different hashes.\n\n### Another common use: drop commits from the middle\n\nYou can remove commits `C` and `D` from a branch `A-B-C-D-E-F` like this:\n\n```bash\ngit rebase --onto B D\n```\n\nThis replays `E` and `F` onto `B`, so the branch becomes `A-B-E'-F'`.\n\n### Things to keep in mind\n- The commits are rewritten, so their hashes change. If you've already pushed the branch, you'll need `git push --force-with-lease`.\n- If the replayed commits depend on the commits you skipped, you'll get conflicts.\n- If something goes wrong, `git rebase --abort` cancels a rebase in progress. After a finished rebase, `git reflog` shows the old commit so you can go back to it."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 7214, "cache_read_input_tokens": 16780, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 7214}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "not_available"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "b3005be0-fb05-4c29-b747-78f127613ccc", "uuid": "000b4b7e-8f76-477e-a1b4-6558ca662946", "timestamp": "2026-10-01T14:52:32.673Z", "request_id": "req_011CfbhwEfSTFDKueun7bshV"}
